    "question": "\\(\\log_3 (\\sqrt[3]{3} \\cdot \\sqrt{3})\\) এর মান কত?",
    "options": "[{\"label\":\"a\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":false},{\"label\":\"b\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":false},{\"label\":\"c\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\frac{5}{6}\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":true},{\"label\":\"d\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":false}]",
    "correctAnswer": "c",
    "explanation": "প্রথমে ভিতরের রাশিটিকে ৩ এর ঘাত আকারে লিখি:\n\\(\\sqrt[3]{3} = 3^{1/3}\\)\n\\(\\sqrt{3} = 3^{1/2}\\)\nগুণফল হবে:\n\\(3^{1/3} \\times 3^{1/2} = 3^{(1/3 + 1/2)}\\)\n\\(\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{2+3}{6} = \\frac{5}{6}\\)\nসুতরাং রাশিটি দাঁড়ায় \\(3^{5/6}\\)।\nএখন লগারিদম প্রয়োগ করি:\n\\(\\log_3 (3^{5/6}) = \\frac{5}{6}\\)",
    "image": null,
    "language": "en"
  },
