    "question": "\\(\\log 625 - 2 \\log 5 = \\text{কত}?\\)",
    "options": "[{\"label\":\"a\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\log 600\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":false},{\"label\":\"b\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\log 125\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":false},{\"label\":\"c\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\log 25\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":true},{\"label\":\"d\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\log 5\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":false}]",
    "correctAnswer": "c",
    "explanation": "লগারিদমের নিয়ম প্রয়োগ করি: \\(n \\log a = \\log (a^n)\\)।\n\\(2 \\log 5 = \\log (5^2) = \\log 25\\)\nএখন বিয়োগফল বের করি:\n\\(\\log 625 - \\log 25\\)\nলগ বিয়োগের নিয়ম: \\(\\log m - \\log n = \\log (\\frac{m}{n})\\)।\n\\(\\log \\left(\\frac{625}{25}\\right) = \\log 25\\)",
    "image": null,
    "language": "en"
  },
