    "question": "\\(\\frac{5 \\cdot 3^{x+1} - 14 \\cdot 3^x}{3^x}\\) এর মান কত?",
    "options": "[{\"label\":\"a\",\"text\":\"২\",\"is_correct\":false},{\"label\":\"b\",\"text\":\"১\",\"is_correct\":true},{\"label\":\"c\",\"text\":\"-১\",\"is_correct\":false},{\"label\":\"d\",\"text\":\"-২\",\"is_correct\":false}]",
    "correctAnswer": "b",
    "explanation": "লব থেকে \\(3^x\\) কমন নিই:\n\\(5 \\cdot 3^{x+1} = 5 \\cdot 3^x \\cdot 3\\)\nলব \\(= 3^x (5 \\times 3 - 14)\\)\n\\(= 3^x (15 - 14)\\)\n\\(= 3^x \\times 1\\)\nএখন পুরো রাশিটি দাঁড়ায়:\n\\(\\frac{3^x \\times 1}{3^x} = 1\\)",
    "image": null,
    "language": "en"
  },
