    "options": "[{\"label\":\"a\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\frac{1}{7}\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":false},{\"label\":\"b\",\"text\":\"\\\\(\\\\frac{5}{3}\\\\)\",\"is_correct\":false},{\"label\":\"c\",\"text\":\"৪\",\"is_correct\":false},{\"label\":\"d\",\"text\":\"৫\",\"is_correct\":true}]",
    "correctAnswer": "d",
    "explanation": "ভিত্তি সমান, তাই সূচকগুলো সমান হবে:\n\\(x + 3 = 2(x - 1)\\)\n\\(x + 3 = 2x - 2\\)\n\\(3 + 2 = 2x - x\\)\n\\(5 = x\\)",
